<p>The four scenes beside this one are finished rooms. <a href="/live/sources/">Live sources</a> takes them apart. This page is the point of taking them apart: <strong>a screen the system has never seen</strong>, assembled in one sitting from parts it already had, and still recognisably the same channel. Nothing below is new to the system except the goal bar — every other line is a class that was already here.</p>

